## ✨ What's Working

### Core Features
✅ **Grid View** - Displays thumbnails in grid layout  
✅ **Performance Overlay** - Right sidebar with all controls  
✅ **Folder Selection** - "📁 Select Folder" button (top-right)  
✅ **Real Image Loading** - Uses AsyncImageProvider  
✅ **Synthetic Test Data** - 10,000 colored rectangles on startup  

### Performance Controls (Right Sidebar)
✅ **Viewport Culling Toggle** - Enable/disable viewport-based loading  
✅ **Frame Budget Toggle** - Enable/disable frame budget limiting  
✅ **Frame Budget Slider** - 1-50 uploads per frame  
✅ **Thumb Resolution Slider** - 128-512px (affects decode quality)  
✅ **FPS Monitor** - Color-coded (green ≥55, yellow ≥30, red <30)  
✅ **Queue Depth** - Real-time pending decode count  
✅ **Memory Usage** - Live MB counter  

---

## 🎮 How to Use

### 1. Launch
```
d:\Dev\antigravity\test_scrollbench\deploy\appScrollBench.exe
```

### 2. Test with Synthetic Data (Default)
- App starts with 10,000 colored rectangles
- Scroll rapidly to test performance
- Toggle viewport culling ON/OFF
- Adjust frame budget (1-50)
- Watch FPS and queue depth change

### 3. Test with Real Images
1. Click "📁 Select Folder" (top-right)
2. Choose folder with 100+ images
3. Wait for scan to complete
4. Scroll and test performance

### 4. Performance Testing
```
Baseline (Optimizations OFF):
- Viewport culling: OFF
- Frame budget: OFF
- Scroll rapidly
- Expected: FPS drops, queue spikes

Optimized (Optimizations ON):
- Viewport culling: ON
- Frame budget: ON (set to 10)
- Scroll rapidly
- Expected: FPS stable 50-60, queue <50
```

---

## 📊 Performance Overlay Controls

| Control | What It Does | Range |
|---------|-------------|-------|
| **Viewport Culling** | Only loads visible items | ON/OFF |
| **Frame Budget** | Limits uploads per frame | ON/OFF |
| **Budget Slider** | Max uploads per frame | 1-50 |
| **Thumb Resolution** | Image decode quality | 128-512px |

**Note**: Thumb resolution affects decode quality and performance, NOT grid cell size.

